  "notes": [
    "The twenty-year companion. The row that will be misread is referenceNodesGainedFinalQuarter, 8.33 -> 4.345 (-38.12 SE): the frontier is reached SOONER, not cut off, and referenceNodesKnown 40.665 -> 44.24 (+19.78 SE) in the same run says the ceiling went up rather than down. referencePeakPopulation 362 -> 381 is the vitality wire's fertility channel becoming reachable in runs that open more of the grid than the v1 rectangle. The universe remains degenerate in the ways integration round 2 recorded, and this change closes none of them: the v1 rectangle still cannot make food, and founding a construction site is still a god action, so a run with no god actions still spends no stone. What moved is knowledge, and living mages did not move with it. Measured 2026-08-14 on w187/effects-union at 9be84ea, four workers, on a machine several agents were sharing. NO GOLDEN FIXTURE WAS REGENERATED and none needed to be. balance-gate-ascension-v1 was deliberately NOT re-recorded: it carries the same superseded contentHash and will refuse for the same reason, but its Actions job is not required to merge and a 830-1150 s sweep is a separate decision on a separate failure."
